{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43159","headline":"耒阳杜工部祠堂 · 徐介","name":"耒阳杜工部祠堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手接汨罗水，天心知所存。\n固教工部死，来伴大夫魂。\n流落同千古，风骚共一源。\n消凝伤往事，斜日隐颓垣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐介","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}